# Paths that hold throwaway keys and tokens on purpose, one literal path per line,
# relative to the root of the repository: a line is the exact path of a file, or a
# directory that ends in a slash for every file below it. No wildcards and no regular
# expressions. Every one is test data: the DKIM keys are generated for the tests, and
# the tokens are strings the tests feed to the parser. A real credential in any of
# these paths would be a mistake, so the list is kept to the exact files and folders,
# not to "tests/". The list counts once it is on the base branch.
